{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/51343-late-to-the-game","id":51343,"title":"Late to the game...","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-01-16T20:41:01-08:00","id":51343,"title":"Late to the game...","content":"So I know that there's a new edition coming just around the corner but I've only recently started playing the current one so bear with me here.<br /> <br /> Is there a list of errata somewhere? I was looking at making a Scion of Bast and noticed she has Vengeance as a Purview. After doing some googling I've found nothing to correct this. Is there a page or document hiding somewhere that has a list of corrections?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1178-ravenmancer","name":"Ravenmancer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"36"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-16T21:19:15-08:00","id":51370,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ravenmancer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/51343-late-to-the-game#post51343\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So I know that there's a new edition coming just around the corner but I've only recently started playing the current one so bear with me here.<br /> <br /> Is there a list of errata somewhere? I was looking at making a Scion of Bast and noticed she has Vengeance as a Purview. After doing some googling I've found nothing to correct this. Is there a page or document hiding somewhere that has a list of corrections?</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm not aware of any errata lists at this time.<br /> <br /> I can answer your question about Bast though. Apparently early on in the game's development, the Justice Purview was going to be called the Vengeance Purview. They decided to switch the name, and someone forgot to make the change when Bast's write-up was printed. She doesn't have the &quot;Vengeance&quot; Purview because there's no such thing. It's the Justice Purview.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">&quot;We have done the impossible, and that makes us mighty.&quot;<br /> Captain Malcolm Reynolds</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/679-unnatural1","name":"unnatural1","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-17T02:09:53-08:00","id":51488,"title":"","content":"There are alot of errata lists and houserules out there.<br /> You should check the whitewolffourms archives.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-19T13:52:55-08:00","id":53427,"title":"","content":"But if a follow-up; How does one resist mind control? The integrity skill implies that it helps and several virtues do as well. But epic manipulation and charisma knacks don't seem to have any contested roll involved. What happens when someone who can fool anyone kiss to someone who can see through any falsehoods?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1178-ravenmancer","name":"Ravenmancer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"36"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-19T14:17:18-08:00","id":53451,"title":"","content":"Well in the RAW, the rules are something like &quot;spend Willpower to just completely negate mind effects.&quot; However, I prefer the Gotham By Night rules which have you roll Willpower+Integrity+Legend against whatever roll the social-thing-doer makes (and they always do make a roll), with certain knacks allowing you to sub in certain attributes in place of Willpower.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/93-xegek","name":"Xegek","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar93_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}